{"id":1140301,"chapter_id":1140301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你为了调查狂厄武器背后推手而安排了相关涉案人进行审查，刚走进审查室，就听见一阵喧哗——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1140300},{"step":2,"speaker":"警卫","content":"“快抓住他！”“锁链锁链！”\n“当心他咬人！”“臭小子，砸得还挺疼！”","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1140300},{"step":3,"content":"警卫慌慌张张堵在门口，手里拿着锁链，目标是一个少年。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1140300},{"step":4,"content":"少年像是会飞檐走壁一般，在审查室内蹿跳闪躲。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1140300},{"step":5,"options":["发生什么事了？"],"style":6,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301006,"trial_step":6,"course":3,"drawing":1140300,"choices":[{"text":"发生什么事了？","goto":7}]},{"step":6,"speaker":"警卫","content":"别让他跑了！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1140300},{"step":7,"content":"你的声音立刻被盖过，审查室内乱做一团，他们还没注意到你的存在。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1140300},{"step":8,"content":"你们这是在……","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1140300},{"step":9,"speaker":"警卫","content":"禁闭者S-076！坐回你的椅子上！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1140300},{"step":10,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我有名字！不许这样命令我！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1140300},{"step":11,"content":"少年表现出异常的愤怒，挥起拳头猛冲向警卫。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1140300},{"step":12,"content":"警卫侧身闪躲，却使你暴露在了狼獾的视线范围内。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1140300},{"step":13,"content":"他明显愣了一下，拳头努力调转方向，却已经收势不住——","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1140300},{"step":14,"content":"……！","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1140300},{"step":15,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"…… ……","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1140300},{"step":16,"speaker":"警卫","content":"局长？您什么时候来的！您……没事吧？","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1140300},{"step":17,"options":["我没事……","当然有事！"],"style":6,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301018,"trial_step":18,"course":3,"drawing":1140300,"choices":[{"text":"我没事……","goto":19},{"text":"当然有事！","goto":21}]},{"step":18,"content":"只是流了点鼻血而已。倒是你们，在审查室里做什么？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1140300},{"step":19,"speaker":"警卫","content":"报告，我们在为审查做准备工作。","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1140300,"next":[23]},{"step":20,"content":"这里是审查室，不是让你们打架斗殴的地方，要打去训练室打。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1140300},{"step":21,"speaker":"警卫","content":"报告，我们不是在打架斗殴。","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1140300,"next":[23]},{"step":22,"speaker":"警卫","content":"禁闭者S-076特别难以管束，我们怕他在审查过程中伤到您，所以要给他戴上锁链限制行动。","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1140300},{"step":23,"options":["他不会伤害我的","他不危险，是你们激怒了他"],"style":6,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301024,"trial_step":24,"course":3,"drawing":1140300,"choices":[{"text":"他不会伤害我的","goto":25},{"text":"他不危险，是你们激怒了他","goto":31}]},{"step":24,"content":"他刚才看到我时，并不想攻击我，只是不小心误伤了。他攻击、反抗你们，肯定是有原因的。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1140300},{"step":25,"content":"对吗，狼獾？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1140300},{"step":26,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你不一样……","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1140300},{"step":27,"content":"什么？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1140300},{"step":28,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"没什么！是他们先动手的！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1140300},{"step":29,"content":"狼獾愤愤盯着警卫手中的锁链。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1140300,"next":[37]},{"step":30,"content":"他不想被拴上锁链，也不希望你们用编号命令他，所以才会表现过激。他刚才并不是有意伤害我的。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1140300},{"step":31,"content":"对吗，狼獾？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1140300},{"step":32,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你不一样……","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1140300},{"step":33,"content":"什么？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1140300},{"step":34,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"没什么！你来干嘛，也是来绑我的？","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1140300},{"step":35,"content":"我手头有个案子想问问你。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1140300,"next":[37]},{"step":36,"content":"如果我让警卫带着锁链离开，审查室里只有我们两个，你愿意回到椅子上配合我的提问吗？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1140300},{"step":37,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"说话算话？","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1140300},{"step":38,"content":"当然。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1140300},{"step":39,"content":"警卫带着伤员陆续退出，审查室的大门再次阖上。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1140300},{"step":40,"content":"一阵窸窸窣窣的响动，黑白相间的毛球从狼獾的斗篷下探出脑袋。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1140300},{"step":41,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"这是阿皮，它刚才吓着了，你不用管它。\n你要问什么就问。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1140300},{"step":42,"content":"那我就不兜圈子了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1140300},{"step":43,"content":"你曾经向黑帮提供狂厄武器的制造原料，对吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1140300},{"step":44,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"没有。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1140300},{"step":45,"content":"但是有黑帮的人指证了，是你提供了死役组织，你怎么解释？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1140300},{"step":46,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"是我给的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1140300},{"step":47,"content":"否认提供武器原料，但承认自己提供死役组织，这不是自相矛盾吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1140300},{"step":48,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我都说了，我只是把那些垃圾给他们了。什么武器不武器的，我听不懂。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1140300},{"step":49,"content":"你……不会是不知道，死役组织是做什么用的吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1140300},{"step":50,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我就是个打猎的，没必要知道。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1140300},{"step":51,"content":"你是锈河的猎手，应该比谁都清楚死役有多危险。你将这么危险的东西交给别人，都不问问他们要拿来做什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1140300},{"step":52,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"没问，关我屁事……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1140304},{"step":53,"content":"你努力平复情绪，说服自己不跟这个野孩子一般计较。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1140304},{"step":54,"content":"死、役、组、织，就是狂、厄、武、器的原料。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1140304},{"step":55,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"哦，所以呢？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1140304},{"step":56,"content":"所以？你的所作所为帮助了狂厄武器的生产，这种武器在辛迪加流通，害死了很多无辜人的生命。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1140304},{"step":57,"content":"他显然还没有意识到自身罪行的严重性，一副不耐烦的样子。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1140304},{"step":58,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我又不认识那些辛迪加人，跟我有什么关系？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1140304},{"step":59,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1140304},{"step":60,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我拿垃圾去跟黑帮换肉，有肉吃、活下去就行了。黑帮那群家伙具体做了什么，我不知道，也不想知道。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1140300},{"step":61,"speaker":"阿皮","content":"嘎！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1140300},{"step":62,"content":"一旁的阿皮也学着他的样子，重重地点头，显然对主人的“吃肉论”非常赞同。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1140300},{"step":63,"content":"除了吃肉，你在他这里什么都问不出来……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1140300},{"step":64,"content":"但调查不能就此结束，只能寄希望从狼獾口中发现与推动狂厄武器生产的秘密黑手相关的线索。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1140300},{"step":65,"content":"你刚刚说到黑帮时，语气并不陌生……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1140300},{"step":66,"options":["黑帮是怎么找上你进行交易的？","你跟“那群家伙”很熟吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301067,"trial_step":67,"course":3,"drawing":1140300,"choices":[{"text":"黑帮是怎么找上你进行交易的？","goto":68},{"text":"你跟“那群家伙”很熟吗？","goto":74}]},{"step":67,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我们之前认识。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1140300},{"step":68,"content":"你们是朋友？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1140300},{"step":69,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"哼，朋友……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1140304},{"step":70,"content":"狼獾咬紧牙齿，发出一声冷笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1140304},{"step":71,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你会把朋友，当做狗来训练吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1140300,"next":[77]},{"step":72,"content":"狼獾咬紧牙齿，发出一声冷笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1140300},{"step":73,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"哼……熟，非常熟。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1140304},{"step":74,"content":"他咬牙切齿地发出一声冷笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1140304},{"step":75,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"他们每天都把我当做狗来骂，不能更熟了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1140304,"next":[77]},{"step":76,"content":"训……所以你和涉嫌狂厄武器生产的黑帮有过长期接触？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1140304},{"step":77,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"是，他们很早之前就开始做这个了，那时候我还在黑帮，专门帮他们打死役。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1140300},{"step":78,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"后来我不在了，他们打不过死役，又回过头来找我帮忙。\n哼，没用的废物……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1140304},{"step":79,"content":"也就是说，狂厄武器交易链的开始，远比你知道的要早得多……这倒是个有效的新信息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1140304},{"step":80,"content":"那你能具体说说，这份名单上的人，都做过什么吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1140300},{"step":81,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":82,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":83,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":84,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":85,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":86,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":87,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":88,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":82,"course":6,"drawing":1140300},{"step":89,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"这个人——","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1140300},{"step":90,"content":"他指了指第一个人的照片。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1140300},{"step":91,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"他是专门让我学寻路的训犬师，逼着我把锈河地图记下来。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1140300},{"step":92,"content":"他又翻了翻文件，指向下一个。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1140300},{"step":93,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"这个，他不让我在桌上吃饭，扔了一个盆在地上，没有抓到死役就没有肉吃。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1140300},{"step":94,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"还有这家伙，带着我去狩猎死役。他太胆小了，每次都让我打头探路，自己躲在队伍最后。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1140300},{"step":95,"content":"几乎每个名字对狼獾来说，都是一道血淋淋的伤痕，他虽装作漫不经心的样子，拳头却越攥越紧。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1140300},{"step":96,"content":"但现在还不是心疼他过去遭遇的时候，他说到的这些还不是你想要的答案。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1140300},{"step":97,"content":"这是黑帮的首领，他应该是名单上最后一个人了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1140300},{"step":98,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"哼，他啊……有一次在锈河，我们被死役包围了，就是这家伙让我挡着死役，等他们拿武器来。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1140304},{"step":99,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"然后，他指挥着所有人，丢下不重要的行李逃掉了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1140301},{"step":100,"content":"他故意撇开了视线避免暴露眼底的情绪，但连阿皮都听出了狼獾的委屈，轻轻呜咽两声聊以安慰。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1140301},{"step":101,"content":"“不重要的行李”……这之中是否包括曾经的狼獾？你没忍心把这个问题问出口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1140301},{"step":102,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"之后，我就一个人在锈河生活，直到这家伙再次回来找我，让我打猎换肉。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1140301},{"step":103,"options":["追问幕后指使"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301097,"trial_step":97,"course":3,"drawing":1140301,"choices":[{"text":"追问幕后指使","goto":98}]},{"step":104,"content":"这个首领有没有听命于什么神秘人物？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1140304},{"step":105,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"不清楚，好像没有。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1140304},{"step":106,"options":["追问狂厄武器情报来源"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301100,"trial_step":100,"course":3,"drawing":1140304,"choices":[{"text":"追问狂厄武器情报来源","goto":101}]},{"step":107,"content":"是谁告诉他们制作狂厄武器的方法的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1140304},{"step":108,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我哪知道。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1140304},{"step":109,"options":["追问狂厄武器销售办法"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301103,"trial_step":103,"course":3,"drawing":1140304,"choices":[{"text":"追问狂厄武器销售办法","goto":104}]},{"step":110,"content":"他们生产那么多武器，都是如何出售的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1140304},{"step":111,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"有完没完了，烦死了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1140300},{"step":112,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我早就跟那群混蛋没关系了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1140304},{"step":113,"content":"狼獾已然是一副起身要走的样子，连阿皮都表现出不耐烦。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1140304},{"step":114,"content":"真的没有别的线索了吗……你刚想做出妥协收起名单，忽然发现资料夹最后还有一页。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1140304},{"step":115,"content":"这似乎是个拾荒者，为什么会跑到黑帮的名单里？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1140304},{"step":116,"options":["叫住狼獾","独自思考"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301110,"trial_step":110,"course":3,"drawing":1140304,"choices":[{"text":"叫住狼獾","goto":111},{"text":"独自思考","goto":115}]},{"step":117,"content":"等一下，先别急着走……还有一个人，好像不是黑帮的，叫做汉克……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1140300},{"step":118,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"汉克？！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1140303},{"step":119,"content":"还没等你往下问，在听到这个名字的一刹那，狼獾一把夺过你手中的资料。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1140303},{"step":120,"content":"照片上这个人你认识？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1140303,"next":[119]},{"step":121,"content":"汉克……这个人和黑帮，和狂厄武器是什么关系？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1140300},{"step":122,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"你刚才说什么？汉克？！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1140303},{"step":123,"content":"怎么，照片上这个人你认识？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1140303},{"step":124,"content":"狼獾一把夺过你手中的资料。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1140303,"next":[119]},{"step":125,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"不只是认识，这臭老头就算化成灰我都记得他！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1140302},{"step":126,"content":"狼獾从牙缝里挤出这几个字，如果这个人站在他面前，他可能会因愤怒当场失控。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1140302},{"step":127,"content":"你们是什么关系？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1140302},{"step":128,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"没有关系！他是我的仇人！这老头要是让我在锈河见到，肯定见一次打他一次！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1140302},{"step":129,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"他用好听的话把人骗上钩，然后一发现有利用的价值，立刻就把人卖了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1140302},{"step":130,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"我本来一个人在锈河活得好好的，是他把我从锈河骗出来，忽悠进黑帮，拿了钱拍拍屁股走了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1140302},{"step":131,"content":"原来汉克就是让狼獾陷入黑帮这个泥淖的根源吗？为黑帮提供了打手，那出现在名单中倒也不奇怪了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1140302},{"step":132,"content":"狼獾愤怒的斥责声夹杂些许委屈，看来他不只有被黑帮驯化这一件伤心事，或许这份附件资料能给他些许安慰——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1140302},{"step":133,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":134,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":135,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":136,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":137,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":138,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":139,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":127,"course":6,"drawing":1140302},{"step":140,"content":"你应该开心才对，你的仇人已经死了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1140302},{"step":141,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"啊？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1140303},{"step":142,"content":"你的仇人，汉克，已经确认死亡了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1140303},{"step":143,"content":"狼獾的呼吸一滞，茫然地看着你，什么也没有说，审查室内一片寂静。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1140303},{"step":144,"content":"阿皮戳了戳僵住的主人，但狼獾过了好久才有反应。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1140303},{"step":145,"speaker":"狼獾","content":"死……死了？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1140303},{"step":146,"content":"对。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1140303},{"step":147,"content":"他又一次重复了问题，声音干涩得跟从喉咙里挤